<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbustīvus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		arbustum
		 (only in Col.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Planted with trees</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 13, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Bound</i> or <i>fastened to a
			tree</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 1, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Arb. 4, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">16, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">positio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					1, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbusti Aminei urna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 41, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus musti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 41, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
